# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Data & large files
#
# The Streamlit Community Cloud deploy has no filesystem of its own, so the
# handful of files the dashboard actually reads must be committed. Everything
# else stays out.
#
# Git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded, so each
# data directory is excluded by contents ("Dir/*") rather than as a directory,
# and the required files are re-included with "!" below.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

*.parquet
*.pkl
*.csv

# Raw Data is never deployed (431 MB, and the app never reads it) - with one
# exception: 07_build_gold_features.py needs the bathymetric curve to convert
# level to volume. It is a 297-byte static lookup table, not bulk raw data.
Raw Data/*
Raw Data/Kinneret_Level/*
!Raw Data/Kinneret_Level/
!Raw Data/Kinneret_Level/Lake Kinneret Bathymetric and Hypsometric Curve.csv

# ── Gold Data ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Gold Data/*
!Gold Data/kinneret_gold_features.csv
!Gold Data/longrange_climatology.csv
# Page 9 (Climate Scenarios) reads these two; cordex_ensemble.parquet (28 MB)
# is an intermediate the app never opens, so it stays out.
!Gold Data/cordex_waterbalance.parquet
!Gold Data/cordex_hindcast.parquet

# ── Silver Data ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Silver Data/*
Silver Data/Meteorological/*
Silver Data/Kinneret Level/*
Silver Data/Jordan River Silver/*
!Silver Data/Meteorological/
!Silver Data/Kinneret Level/
!Silver Data/Jordan River Silver/
!Silver Data/Meteorological/met_data_daily.csv
!Silver Data/Meteorological/met_data_daily_clean.csv
!Silver Data/Meteorological/met_data_daily_qc_log.csv
!Silver Data/Meteorological/precip_intensity_daily.csv
!Silver Data/Kinneret Level/kinneret_level.csv
!Silver Data/Jordan River Silver/jordan_river_daily_flow.csv
!Silver Data/Jordan River Silver/jordan_river_daily_flow_clean.csv
!Silver Data/Jordan River Silver/jordan_river_flow_qc_log.csv
# NEVER un-ignore met_data_wide.csv: it is 207 MB, over GitHub's 100 MB
# hard per-file limit. Nothing in kinneret_app reads it. The only consumers
# are pipeline steps 02/03/04/07b, and 07b now skips cleanly without it.
Silver Data/Meteorological/met_data_wide.csv
# Local .bak safety copies are not deployment artefacts.
*.bak.csv

# ── Models ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Models/*
!Models/*.pkl
!Models/model_metadata.json
# The GRU was retired 2026-06-01 and would drag torch into the image.
Models/gru_multitask.pt

# ── Root-level data ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Page 6 (Forecast Live) loads this as its "Load template" default.
!forecast_input_template.csv

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Python cache
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.env

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# IDE & OS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/
.idea/
*.DS_Store

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local working artefacts (not deployed, not shared)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
kinneret_app/offset lake.png
graphify-out/
dreams/
.pytest_cache/

# Reports/ holds dan's daily run logs AND draft correspondence to the Water
# Authority. This repository is public - keep it out.
Reports/

# Local analysis workbooks.
Data Analysisi/
